# GENIE.AI fork of OPEA v1.5 comps/rerankings/src/requirements.in.
# Source: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/opea-project/GenAIComps/v1.5/comps/rerankings/src/requirements.in
# Regenerate the lock with:
#   uv pip compile --generate-hashes --python-version 3.11 --python-platform x86_64-manylinux_2_31 requirements.in -o requirements-cpu.txt
#
# Deltas vs upstream (compiled-lock source, PRD FR-4 / arch decision D7):
#   - kneed (GenieTEIReranking class dependency, previously pip-installed at
#     build time in the Dockerfile; now compiled into the lock).
#   - docarray/langchain/fastapi pinned to the versions OPEA v1.5's compiled
#     lock ships — recompiling the bare .in today resolves to newer packages
#     that do NOT pair with v1.5 comps source.
#   - opentelemetry-instrumentation extras appended below so the Dockerfile's
#     separate unhashed otel install block can be retired.

